\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the grids, October to November ran 61% of normal in 2025, and November to December ran 45% of normal in 2025. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids shows January to February at 48% of normal and February to March 2026 at 49%.</p>"}
